OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome brightness to start in the
OL,6,Fnorth, but cloud and rain soon
OL,7,Fspreading in from the south through
OL,8,Fthe morning. Staying largely cloudy,
OL,9,Fwith showery rain at times. Although
OL,10,Fthe odd brighter spell is possible.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy overnight
OL,13,Fwith patchy rain and drizzle becoming
OL,14,Fmore widespread across the region.
OL,15,FMilder than recent nights of late.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA damp and cloudy start
OL,18,Facross much of the region. This
OL,19,Fgradually moves eastward through the
OL,20,Fafternoon allowing for some brightness
OL,21,Fthrough the evening in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
