OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FWet
OL,6,Fand windy on Wednesday, before sunny
OL,7,Fspells and showers develop into
OL,8,FThursday with lighter winds. Then
OL,9,Fheavy rain will spread northeastwards
OL,10,Finto Friday with strong winds likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
